{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52443","headline":"回波乐 八十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 八十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富儿少男女，穷汉生一羣。\n身上无衣着（一作「挂」），长头草里存（一作「蹲」）。\n到大（一作「例头」）肥没忽，直似饱糠{牛丨=乚}（一作「{月牛}」，项校「{月牛}」）。\n长大充兵朴（一作「兵夫来」），未解起（项校「弃」）家门。\n积代不得富，号曰（一作「名」）穷汉村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}